        "text": "A California regulation grants labor organizations a right to take access to agricultural employers\u2019 property to solicit union support."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Cedar Point Nursery and Fowler Packing Company (growers)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "985ad4d406c5023bfe83866989b7cf8f6e411d64a621de99d45a0edf418c84f9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-985ad4d406c5-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Cedar Point Nursery and Fowler Packing Company (growers), according to Cedar Point Nursery and Fowler Packing Company (growers), the growers contend that this regulation amounts to an unconstitutional per se physical taking under the Fifth and Fourteenth Amendments."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "985ad4d406c5023bfe83866989b7cf8f6e411d64a621de99d45a0edf418c84f9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-985ad4d406c5-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court holds that when government regulation restricts an owner\u2019s ability to use his own property, a different takings standard applies."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "985ad4d406c5023bfe83866989b7cf8f6e411d64a621de99d45a0edf418c84f9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-985ad4d406c5-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh, in his concurrence, determined that the access regulation gives rise to a per se physical taking."
      }
    ],
